id: DRAFT-boost1.84-coroutine-1.84.0-readonly-tmpdir-redirect-guard-page-fallback
trigger_tool: conan|cmake|ctest
phase: build|testing
error_signature: Read-only file system|HMBS_PLATFORM_CAPABILITIES.*tmpdir|protected_stack_allocator.*mprotect|mprotect.*guard
severity: 3
category: ohos, platform, portability, syscall, build-system, cmake, testing
match_keywords: readonly_tmp, hmbs_platform_capabilities, protected_stack_allocator, hmbs_tmpdir, mprotect
title: HarmonyOS只读/tmp环境下TMPDIR重定向与mprotect守卫页受限时stack_allocator降级策略
root_cause: HarmonyOS真机预检环境/tmp为只读挂载，直接写入/tmp触发Read-only file system；同时protected_stack_allocator依赖mprotect设置守卫页，在受限沙箱中mprotect被拒绝抛异常，两者分别阻塞编译期临时文件与运行期协程栈分配，属平台能力限制而非单库缺陷
verification_cmd: 真机preflight日志显示HMBS_PLATFORM_CAPABILITIES.tmpdir已注入且TMPDIR指向可写路径，无Read-only file system报错；test_package中standard_stack_allocator必过，protected路径try/catch转为SKIP非FAIL，HMBS_TEST_PACKAGE_RESULT与HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT均为passed
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: tmpdir-redirect-with-guard-page-fallback
rec_description: 配方与测试包双层TMPDIR重定向复用HMBS注入可写路径，并将mprotect守卫页受限的protected_stack_allocator降级为standard_stack_allocator且标记SKIP，移除与libc++冲突的-static-libstdc++并持久化上游测试证据，提炼为跨库可复用的只读/tmp与guard页兼容模式
rec_command: conanfile.py新增_writable_tmpdir()复用HMBS_TMPDIR/HMBS_PLATFORM_CAPABILITIES.tmpdir并在build()导出TMPDIR/TMP/TEMP透传至clang/ar子进程；test_package/conanfile.py在build()/test()前置同逻辑并透传；test_boost_coroutine.cpp将protected_stack_allocator调用包裹try/catch失败时SKIP而非FAIL
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: disable-protected-allocator-only
fallback_description: 若可写TMPDIR注入不可用，至少禁用protected_stack_allocator仅保留standard_stack_allocator路径，避免mprotect失败导致用例FAIL，临时文件改为使用当前构建目录
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: protected_stack_allocator.*FAIL|FAIL.*protected|/tmp/.*Read-only file system
forbid_1_reason: 禁止将protected_stack_allocator的mprotect失败判为FAIL或硬编码写入只读/tmp；前者在HarmonyOS受限环境为预期受限，后者直接触发只读文件系统错误
forbid_1_consequence: 用例被误判失败导致test_package_result_invalid或temporary_directory_readonly持续不收敛，门禁evidence incomplete退回
similar_to: [DRAFT-boost-1.84.0-compiler-error-clang-ice-adjacent]
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-boost1.84-coroutine-1.84.0-readonly-tmpdir-redirect-guard-page-fallback.md
last_updated: 2026-09-06
source_event: boost1.84-coroutine/1.84.0 真机预检 Read-only file system与protected_stack_allocator mprotect兼容性修复后门禁通过
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 8536
affected_scope: 依赖Boost.Coroutine/Context等使用protected_stack_allocator或mprotect守卫页的协程栈分配，以及构建期向/tmp写入临时文件的C/C++库在HarmonyOS只读/tmp沙箱中
